From: fl1ck3r <fl1ck3r@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: spi: qpic-snand: add IPQ5018 compatible string

Add qcom,ipq5018-snand to the driver match table so the QPIC SNAND
controller is probed directly on IPQ5018 without relying on the
ipq9574-snand fallback compatible.

Signed-off-by: fl1ck3r <fl1ck3r@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/drivers/spi/spi-qpic-snand.c
+++ b/drivers/spi/spi-qpic-snand.c
@@ -1695,6 +1695,10 @@ static const struct qcom_nandc_props ipq9574_snandc_props = {
 };
 
 static const struct of_device_id qcom_snandc_of_match[] = {
+	{
+		.compatible = "qcom,ipq5018-snand",
+		.data = &ipq9574_snandc_props,
+	},
 	{
 		.compatible = "qcom,ipq9574-snand",
 		.data = &ipq9574_snandc_props,
